 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Hundred Note - Night Owl"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "ハンドレッドノート－ナイトアウル－"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "The fastidious wimpy crybaby detective, Sumeragi Sento, and his twin assistants, Hoshibami Mete and Hoshibami Yunde, are cloaked in a dubious atmosphere. The detective agency \"Night Owl\" is willing to take on any request, depending on money and conditions. There is a girl whose organs have been stolen, a top dancer who has disappeared, and surrounded by the presence of money and violence, the Owl eats rats today.\n___\nNote: Based on the series of short animations on Youtube @hundrednote100, with each detective having their own channel.",
   "ja": "泣き虫で弱虫で潔癖症な名探偵・皇千ト。怪しげな雰囲気をまとう双子の助手・星喰右手と星喰左手。探偵事務所「ナイトアウル」は、金と条件次第でどんな依頼も請け負うという。内臓を奪われた少女、消えたトップダンサー、そして……。金と暴力の気配に包まれて、フクロウは今日もネズミを喰らう。"
  },
